MNM2 net2 Vn net25 Vss nfet_01v8 W=1u L=300n M=1
MNM1 Out_N Out_P net2 Vss nfet_01v8 W=1u L=300n M=1
MNM0 Out_P Out_N net3 Vss nfet_01v8 W=1u L=300n M=1
XI1 Vss Trimb<4> Trimb<3> Trimb<2> Trimb<1> Trimb<0> net3 / sar_afe_b__trim
